## Critical Rules

1. Brand: Read `.skills/brand_originality.md` before ANY UI — block AI-look patterns
2. Mobile: Read `.skills/mobile_first.md` — design mobile first, use dvh, min 48px touch targets  
3. Security: Read `.skills/security.md` — JWT in HttpOnly cookies only, never localStorage
4. Animation: Read `.skills/animation_motion.md` — only transform+opacity, always prefers-reduced-motion
5. Copy: Read `.skills/content_copywriting.md` — specific human copy, no AI clichés
6. Architecture: Read `.skills/folder_structure.md` — feature-first, never file-type grouping

